## Overview

this group of projects/tasks document relatively basic AD processes (user & group management, organizational units, group policy, etc).

## Environment

Device: [Windows Server VM (DC01) + Windows 11 Pro VM]
OS: [Windows Server 2025 / Windows 11 Pro]
